            "review_title": "Review at Spice Garden Tam Coc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "M Lu\nMilan, Italy504 contributions\n0\nToo touristy, better to go elsewhere\nAug 2026 • Family\nThe location is cute and the restaurant is pleasant, but unfortunately, as far as the food is concerned, our experience was not the best.\n\nThe dishes we ordered arrived within a few minutes, giving the impression that they were already prepared. The flavors, honestly, did not thrill us and the meat was really very tough, almost like a shoe sole.\n\nOverall, we found the restaurant definitely too touristy and poorly maintained in terms of food quality.\n\nPersonally, I would recommend choosing another restaurant.\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten August 22, 2026",
