            "review_text": "J A\n38 contributions\n0\nThe worst meal we’ve ever had in Vietnam\nJan 2026 • Family\nThe worst meal we’ve eaten in Vietnam during our visits to this country. Unfortunately, we were brought here as part of our tour. It was away from the pretty ambiance of the waterfront. Despite there being many tables available on the first two floors, we weren’t allowed to sit there. We were sent to the third floor where the tables weren’t even setup for guests. The staff who served us were unfriendly. The bathrooms were dirty and unmaintained. The menu was small and the food we ordered wasn’t good and it clearly wasn’t fresh. We would never recommend this restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten January 6, 2026",
